msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前置要求"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart/share_kv_cache.rst:16
msgid "Your server should have at least 2 GPUs."
msgstr "您的服务器应至少有 2 个 GPU。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart/share_kv_cache.rst:18
msgid ""
"For Centralized sharing, this will use the port 8000 and 8001 (for vLLM) and"
" port 65432 (for LMCache)."
msgstr "对于集中式共享，将使用端口 8000 和 8001（用于 vLLM）以及端口 65432（用于 LMCache）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/quickstart/share_kv_cache.rst:20
msgid ""
"For P2P sharing, this will use the port 8000 and 8001 for 2 vllms, And will "
"use port 8200 and 8201 for 2 distributed cache servers, And will use port "
"8100 for lookup server."
msgstr ""
"对于 P2P 共享，将使用端口 8000 和 8001 用于 2 个 vLLM，端口 8200 和 8201 用于 2 个分布式缓存服务器，端口 "
"8100 用于查找服务器。"

